# src/shared/auth/

JWT authentication module using Passport.

- `auth.module.ts` — configures JwtModule + PassportModule
- `auth.service.ts` — validates admin credentials, issues tokens
- `auth.controller.ts` — `POST /auth/login`
- `jwt.strategy.ts` — extracts Bearer token, validates payload
- `guards/jwt-auth.guard.ts` — `@UseGuards(JwtAuthGuard)` on routes
- `decorators/current-user.decorator.ts` — `@CurrentUser()` param decorator
- `dto/login.dto.ts` — login request shape
- `interceptors/logging.interceptor.ts` — request logging
